Wrote the label file for Josh Becker on `ai-regulation`. The one source (SB 942, California AI Transparency Act) is his own act (authored, signed into law 2024) and on-question, but its mechanism — mandatory content-disclosure/detection requirements with civil penalties — doesn't clause-match any rung's specific oversight mechanism (voluntary guidelines, harm-based liability, safety testing, or pre-deployment approval), so it codes as `direction-only` and the row is `BLANK`/`direction-only` with no quotes to tier.
